  "title": "Sectoral Plan Military (SPM) (points)",
  "description": "The Sectoral Plan Military (SPM) is a planning and coordination tool belonging to the Federal Government within the meaning of Article 13 of the Swiss Spatial Planning Act (SPA, SR 700). It is used for ensuring territorial security and for reconciling military infrastructure and activities with civilian space requirements. The published INTERLIS transfer carries no coordinates; this collection uses it completed with the geometries of the same dataset's File Geodatabase export.",
